### Database requirements

- Implement Row Level Security.
- Users must only access their own financial records.
- Add indexes on user_id, transaction_date and category_id.
- Add uniqueness constraints for import idempotency where appropriate.
- Use migrations rather than manually changing production schemas.
- Validate all database relationships.
- Store monetary values as NUMERIC/Decimal, not floating-point values.
- Avoid storing unnecessary personal information.

Seed system categories through a migration.

