# 23. ACCEPTANCE CRITERIA

The MVP is complete only when all of the following are demonstrably working:

[ ] User can register and log in.

[ ] User can access a protected financial dashboard.

[ ] User can import a CSV transaction statement.

[ ] User can preview and validate imported transactions.

[ ] User can correct transaction categories.

[ ] Dashboard metrics reflect actual stored transactions.

[ ] Expense charts are calculated from actual data.

[ ] Monthly spending trends work.

[ ] Cash-flow forecast works when sufficient data exists.

[ ] Insufficient historical data is handled correctly.

[ ] Anomaly detection produces explainable alerts.

[ ] User can ask financial questions through Copilot.

[ ] Copilot invokes specialized tools.

[ ] Copilot answers are supported by tool results.

[ ] Scenario simulations calculate correctly.

[ ] Authentication and RLS protect user data.

[ ] Application works on desktop and mobile.

[ ] AI failure does not break core financial features.

[ ] Application is deployed and accessible.

[ ] README includes installation and usage instructions.

[ ] Demo dataset is included and clearly labelled.

[ ] No fake banking integration is represented as live.

[ ] No critical security or runtime errors remain.

